<title>FINLAND: FISKARS Q1 PRE-TAX PROFIT RISES 44 PCT.</title>
<headline>FISKARS Q1 PRE-TAX PROFIT RISES 44 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to end-March,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	     59 vs 41</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   5.30 vs 3.50</p>
<p> Net sales					    652 vs 581</p>
<p> Operating profit				    71 vs 54</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish consumer goods</p>
<p>manufacturer Fiskars Oy Q1 profit beofre extraordinary items had</p>
<p>been 50 million markka (range 43-77 million).</p>
<p> Share of associated companies' result	  1 vs nil</p>
<p> Net financial items			charge 13 vs 13 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary income after taxes	     nil vs 475</p>
<p> Profit before taxes				 59 vs 516</p>
<p> Taxes						   20 vs 15</p>
<p> Net profit					    39 vs 501</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)		49 vs 50</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish consumer products group is</p>
<p>Fiskars Oy Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245, news@reuters.fi</p>
